{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2021-12-14 16:16:00', 'title': 'CONSTANCE HUNTER JOINS AIG AS GLOBAL HEAD OF STRATEGY & ESG', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CONSTANCE HUNTER WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL HEAD OF STRATEGY & ESG IN EARLY 2022. MS. HUNTER WILL REPORT TO PETER ZAFFINO, PRESIDENT & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND WILL JOIN AIG'S EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM. MR. ZAFFINO SAID: “I AM VERY PLEASED TO ADD SOMEONE OF CONSTANCE'S CALIBER TO OUR LEADERSHIP TEAM. SHE BRINGS A DATA-DRIVEN MINDSET AND DEEP ECONOMIC INSIGHTS INFOR"}